{"page":261,"verses":[{"verse_key":"14:43","surah":14,"ayah":43,"ar_uthmani":"مُهْطِعِينَ مُقْنِعِى رُءُوسِهِمْ لَا يَرْتَدُّ إِلَيْهِمْ طَرْفُهُمْ ۖ وَأَفْـِٔدَتُهُمْ هَوَآءٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will rush forward, craning their necks, unable to divert their eyes, a gaping void in their hearts.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مُهْطِعِينَ","en_gloss":"Racing ahead","transliteration":"muh'ṭiʿīna","verse_key":"14:43"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مُقْنِعِى","en_gloss":"raised up","transliteration":"muq'niʿī","verse_key":"14:43"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رُءُوسِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their heads","transliteration":"ruūsihim","verse_key":"14:43"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"14:43"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَرْتَدُّ","en_gloss":"returning","transliteration":"yartaddu","verse_key":"14:43"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"towards them","transliteration":"ilayhim","verse_key":"14:43"},{"pos":7,"ar":"طَرْفُهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"their gaze","transliteration":"ṭarfuhum","verse_key":"14:43"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَأَفْـِٔدَتُهُمْ","en_gloss":"and their hearts","transliteration":"wa-afidatuhum","verse_key":"14:43"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هَوَآءٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) empty","transliteration":"hawāon","verse_key":"14:43"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٤٣","en_gloss":"(43)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"14:43"}]},{"verse_key":"14:44","surah":14,"ayah":44,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَنذِرِ ٱلنَّاسَ يَوْمَ يَأْتِيهِمُ ٱلْعَذَابُ فَيَقُولُ ٱلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوا۟ رَبَّنَآ أَخِّرْنَآ إِلَىٰٓ أَجَلٍ قَرِيبٍ نُّجِبْ دَعْوَتَكَ وَنَتَّبِعِ ٱلرُّسُلَ ۗ أَوَلَمْ تَكُونُوٓا۟ أَقْسَمْتُم مِّن قَبْلُ مَا لَكُم مِّن زَوَالٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So warn people of the Day when punishment will come to them, and when the disbelievers will say, ‘Our Lord, give us a little more time: we shall answer Your call and follow the messengers.’ Did you [disbelievers] not swear in the past that your power would have no end?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَنذِرِ","en_gloss":"And warn","transliteration":"wa-andhiri","vers