oss":"(51)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"14:51"}]},{"verse_key":"14:52","surah":14,"ayah":52,"ar_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا بَلَـٰغٌ لِّلنَّاسِ وَلِيُنذَرُوا۟ بِهِۦ وَلِيَعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّمَا هُوَ إِلَـٰهٌ وَٰحِدٌ وَلِيَذَّكَّرَ أُو۟لُوا۟ ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"This is a message to all people, so that they may be warned by it, and know that He is the only God, and so that those who have minds may take heed.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"This","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"14:52"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَلَـٰغٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a Message","transliteration":"balāghun","verse_key":"14:52"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِّلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"for the mankind","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"14:52"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَلِيُنذَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"that they may be warned","transliteration":"waliyundharū","verse_key":"14:52"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"with it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"14:52"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلِيَعْلَمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and that they may know","transliteration":"waliyaʿlamū","verse_key":"14:52"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَنَّمَا","en_gloss":"that only","transliteration":"annamā","verse_key":"14:52"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"14:52"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَـٰهٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) One God","transliteration":"ilāhun","verse_key":"14:52"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٰحِدٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) One God","transliteration":"wāḥidun","verse_key":"14:52"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلِيَذَّكَّرَ","en_gloss":"and that may take heed","transliteration":"waliyadhakkara","verse_key":"14:52"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أُو۟لُوا۟","en_gloss":"men","transliteration":"ulū","verse_key":"14:52"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) understanding","transliteration":"l-albābi","verse_key":"14:52"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٥٢","en_gloss":"(52)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"14:52"}]}]}